Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.95,0:22:52.46,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Good afternoon. Rin here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.05,0:22:55.20,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Do you want to hear a scary story?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.20,0:23:00.28,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,The skeleton of the science room walks to the music room at night.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.85,0:23:04.86,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,There he plays "who laughs first" with Beethoven. {niramekko is a game where you keep watching to the other person's face, until someone laughs}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.74,0:23:10.02,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Reina-chan told me that inside a really dark futon.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.02,0:23:12.20,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,After that, she told the adults too.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.99,0:23:16.42,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,The next story is "Secretly Running Away From Home"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.45,0:23:21.41,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, take me to the bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.97,0:01:05.23,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}ashita no koto wa wakannai
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.23,0:01:08.65,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}kore tte gisei to wa chigau
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.65,0:01:10.35,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}nanika ga chigau
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.35,0:01:13.97,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}batsu ge-mu ja nante omowanai
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.97,0:01:17.22,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}de nande na no ka wa wakannai
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.22,0:01:20.62,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}chotto shakuzen to shinai kedo
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.62,0:01:26.17,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}kimi no sonzai ima daiji da nante mon ja nai
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.67,0:01:32.43,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}owaranai koto nante kono yo no doko ni mo nai
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.54,0:01:36.98,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}naku no wa tsurain ja nai no
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.98,0:01:39.68,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}ai no Sweet Drops, Sweet Drops
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.68,0:01:43.12,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}zutto yume mite itai ne
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.12,0:01:46.25,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}motto yasashiku shitai ne
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.64,0:01:50.01,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}kimi to iraretara Happy
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.01,0:01:53.23,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}onna no ko tte tsuyoi ne
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.23,0:01:56.54,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}dakedo tokidoki yowai ne
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.90,0:02:03.23,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}bokura no negai wa Happy Happy Happy
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.23,0:02:06.67,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}sonna hibi mo Happy
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.11,0:02:14.38,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Just wanna make you happy
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.97,0:01:05.23,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}We don't know what'll happen tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.23,0:01:08.65,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}This feels different from a sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.65,0:01:10.35,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Something feels different.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.35,0:01:13.97,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}I'm not thinking of it as a punishment game.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.97,0:01:17.22,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}I still don't know why.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.22,0:01:20.62,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Even though I don't quite feel satisfied with that,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.62,0:01:26.17,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}there's no question that you're important to me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.67,0:01:32.43,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}There's nothing in this world that's endless.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.54,0:01:36.77,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Isn't it painful having to cry?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.98,0:01:39.57,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Love's sweet drops, sweet drops.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.68,0:01:43.12,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Don't you want to keep dreaming forever?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.12,0:01:46.25,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Don't you want to be kinder?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.64,0:01:50.01,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}As long as I'm with you, I'm happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.01,0:01:53.23,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Don't you think girls can be strong?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.23,0:01:56.54,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Even though we can be weak sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.90,0:02:03.23,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Our wish is for happy, happy, happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.23,0:02:06.67,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Those days can also be happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.11,0:02:14.38,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Just wanna make you happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.95,0:20:12.44,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}nichiyou no hareta hirusagari
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.11,0:20:15.97,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}kyou wa doko e yukou?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.37,0:20:22.93,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}kayoi nareta itsumo no michi ga
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.93,0:20:27.53,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}mabushiku kagayaite mieru
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.66,0:20:32.88,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}terasu atatakai taiyou to
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.90,0:20:37.96,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}tonari ni kimi ga ireba
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.96,0:20:42.04,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}mou High High High
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.63,0:20:47.91,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}hashagidasu kimochi ni
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.27,0:20:52.48,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}utae Life Life Life
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.12,0:20:58.79,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}koe wa dokomademo
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.79,0:21:02.95,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}mou High High High
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.61,0:21:08.57,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}maiagaru kaze ni nori
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.26,0:21:13.43,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}utae Life Life Life
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.95,0:21:22.49,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}koe mo tobihaneru
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.95,0:20:12.44,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}It's a sunny Sunday, early in the afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.11,0:20:15.97,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Where should we go today?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.37,0:20:22.93,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}This path I've grown so used to taking
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.93,0:20:27.53,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}seems to be shining brightly,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.66,0:20:32.88,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}as long as the warm sun is shining
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.90,0:20:37.96,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}and you are here beside me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.96,0:20:42.04,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}I'm already high, high, high.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.63,0:20:47.91,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}I feel like frolicking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.27,0:20:52.48,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Let's sing, life, life, life.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.12,0:20:58.79,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Our voices can go anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.79,0:21:02.95,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}I'm already high, high, high.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.61,0:21:08.57,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}I'm riding on the rising wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.26,0:21:13.43,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Let's sing, life, life, life.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.95,0:21:22.49,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Even our voices will be bouncing.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:02.89,0:00:04.02,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay?
Dialogue: 4,0:00:04.02,0:00:05.60,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Um...
Dialogue: 4,0:00:05.60,0:00:06.48,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 4,0:00:08.36,0:00:10.65,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,It's all blurry.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:12.32,0:00:15.32,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan, Kouki, stand next to each other!
Dialogue: 4,0:00:15.32,0:00:16.37,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 4,0:00:16.78,0:00:17.95,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-kun!
Dialogue: 4,0:00:20.79,0:00:22.45,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Say "cheese"!
Dialogue: 4,0:00:25.67,0:00:29.04,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Next, I'll take a photo of you with Rin-chan, Daikichi-san.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:29.04,0:00:31.05,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Nah, I don't need a shot of myself.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:31.05,0:00:34.80,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,You have to! She'll grow up before you know it.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:34.80,0:00:36.55,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,So you have to keep a record of everything!
Dialogue: 4,0:00:37.59,0:00:38.60,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Sure.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:40.93,0:00:44.35,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi-san, your expression is stiff...
Dialogue: 4,0:02:39.68,0:02:41.09,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Again?!
Dialogue: 4,0:02:45.77,0:02:50.23,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Rin! How many times have I told you not to go wandering off?!
Dialogue: 4,0:02:50.23,0:02:51.60,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Uh-huh...
Dialogue: 4,0:02:51.60,0:02:54.77,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,You're a big girl now, so shape up!
Dialogue: 4,0:02:54.77,0:02:56.23,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Uh-huh...
Dialogue: 4,0:02:56.23,0:02:58.90,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Don't just say "Uh-huh"!
Dialogue: 4,0:02:58.90,0:03:01.70,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, can we buy this for a snack?
Dialogue: 4,0:03:02.66,0:03:04.16,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,A snack?!
Dialogue: 4,0:03:05.33,0:03:07.75,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Well, it looked good...
Dialogue: 4,0:03:10.71,0:03:13.04,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Haven't you ever had cereal before?
Dialogue: 4,0:03:13.04,0:03:13.96,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,No.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:14.54,0:03:17.09,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe it's too much for me?
Dialogue: 4,0:03:17.09,0:03:19.72,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,No, I don't mind buying it...
Dialogue: 4,0:03:19.72,0:03:22.59,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,But that's the kind of thing you have for breakfast.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:23.01,0:03:25.47,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It's okay to eat sweets with rice?
Dialogue: 4,0:03:25.47,0:03:29.35,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Hmm... It does look like a sweet...
Dialogue: 4,0:03:29.35,0:03:31.35,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,But you can have it as a meal.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:31.35,0:03:33.06,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,You put milk on it.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:33.06,0:03:34.61,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Huh...?
Dialogue: 4,0:03:35.40,0:03:37.23,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Why don't you have it for breakfast tomorrow?
Dialogue: 4,0:03:37.23,0:03:39.07,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah! I will.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:39.07,0:03:40.99,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Are you going to have it too, Daikichi?
Dialogue: 4,0:03:40.99,0:03:43.57,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Nah. It doesn't fill me up...
Dialogue: 4,0:03:45.74,0:03:47.70,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Put your cereal in here.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:47.70,0:03:48.37,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 4,0:03:51.96,0:03:53.96,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, you're terrible at that.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:53.96,0:03:56.21,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I'm losing the oils in my hand...
Dialogue: 4,0:03:56.21,0:03:57.67,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,You're like Grandpa!
Dialogue: 4,0:03:57.67,0:03:58.88,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, shut up!
Dialogue: 4,0:03:58.88,0:04:00.51,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Then I'll watch you do it!
Dialogue: 4,0:04:05.22,0:04:08.43,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, there are cherry blossoms over there, so let's go home this way.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:08.43,0:04:09.31,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Sure.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:10.14,0:04:12.48,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,They're blooming all over the place!
Dialogue: 4,0:04:12.48,0:04:14.23,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Because it's warm out.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:16.69,0:04:18.77,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Huge, isn't it?
Dialogue: 4,0:04:18.77,0:04:20.19,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,They're in full bloom.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:21.53,0:04:23.70,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Since you're just starting elementary school,
Dialogue: 4,0:04:23.70,0:04:25.70,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,what do you say we plant something to commemorate it?
Dialogue: 4,0:04:25.70,0:04:26.66,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Commemorate?
Dialogue: 4,0:04:27.12,0:04:29.62,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,It's kind of like a remembrance.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:30.37,0:04:34.67,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Every year, both you and the tree would get bigger.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:34.67,0:04:36.08,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Huh...
Dialogue: 4,0:04:37.13,0:04:38.96,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,You know, I have my own tree.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:38.96,0:04:40.30,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,At home?
Dialogue: 4,0:04:40.30,0:04:41.55,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,At my parents' house.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:42.67,0:04:45.30,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,When I was born, they planted a fragrant olive tree.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:45.30,0:04:48.30,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,For Kazumi, they planted a tea olive tree.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:48.30,0:04:50.72,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Are fragrant olive trees the ones that smell good?
Dialogue: 4,0:04:50.72,0:04:51.60,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,That's right.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:52.02,0:04:54.06,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know the tea olive tree.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:54.06,0:04:58.86,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Let's see, the tea olive tree has some plain flowers and not much of a smell...
Dialogue: 4,0:04:58.86,0:05:02.07,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,That's why Kazumi used to say, "It's not fair!"
Dialogue: 4,0:05:02.07,0:05:04.40,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,And she'd tear the flowers from my olive tree.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:05.07,0:05:09.03,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,When I told her that I'd trade, she said, "I don't want any hand-me-down!"
Dialogue: 4,0:05:10.41,0:05:13.25,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? That's a bad memory,
Dialogue: 4,0:05:13.25,0:05:15.33,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,so why am I thinking about doing the same thing?
Dialogue: 4,0:05:16.12,0:05:18.75,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,But if we're going to do it, I think it'd be more fun
Dialogue: 4,0:05:18.75,0:05:20.79,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,to make it a pretty flower or something that blooms, you know?
Dialogue: 4,0:05:20.79,0:05:22.38,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Or a fruit you can eat...
Dialogue: 4,0:05:22.38,0:05:23.80,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I wanna do a loquat!
Dialogue: 4,0:05:24.84,0:05:25.80,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,A loquat?
Dialogue: 4,0:05:26.38,0:05:27.89,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, a loquat!
Dialogue: 4,0:05:31.68,0:05:34.64,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I had loquat seeds from before.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:34.64,0:05:36.14,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,You plant the seeds?
Dialogue: 4,0:05:37.23,0:05:39.06,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I can eat as many loquats as I want!
Dialogue: 4,0:05:39.06,0:05:40.61,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Only if they actually grow.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:41.11,0:05:45.78,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Actually, I was thinking of planting a tree that's about as tall as you, Rin.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:45.78,0:05:47.07,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I can't plant the loquat seeds?
Dialogue: 4,0:05:48.07,0:05:51.78,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,It takes longer for a tree to get big, compared to morning glories and the like...
Dialogue: 4,0:05:52.49,0:05:53.54,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,It's like that expression.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:53.54,0:05:54.79,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,"It takes 3 years for peaches and chestnuts to bear fruit...
Dialogue: 4,0:05:53.54,0:05:58.46,Main Dialog,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}Note : Proverb meaning "Your actions often take time to bear fruit."
Dialogue: 4,0:05:54.79,0:05:56.37,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,...and persimmons take eight"!
Dialogue: 4,0:05:56.37,0:05:58.79,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,You really are Grandpa's girl, aren't you?
Dialogue: 4,0:05:58.79,0:05:59.92,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,How long for loquats?
Dialogue: 4,0:06:00.33,0:06:04.88,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know, but what if it takes 10 years?
Dialogue: 4,0:06:04.88,0:06:06.76,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I can wait.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:06.76,0:06:10.05,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,By that time, you'll probably be more interested in fancy sweets.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:10.68,0:06:12.60,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I can't imagine it...
Dialogue: 4,0:06:12.60,0:06:14.85,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, hurry up!
Dialogue: 4,0:06:15.35,0:06:18.56,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,If we don't hurry, it'll be a long time before we can eat them!
Dialogue: 4,0:06:18.56,0:06:20.10,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, yeah...
Dialogue: 4,0:06:22.31,0:06:24.15,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Is this enough?
Dialogue: 4,0:06:24.15,0:06:28.28,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. If it's too deep, the bud won't be able to come up.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:28.28,0:06:29.07,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:35.70,0:06:38.54,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,You're Grandpa's girl through and through...
Dialogue: 4,0:06:38.54,0:06:40.75,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I hope the bud comes up soon!
Dialogue: 4,0:06:40.75,0:06:41.63,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Yep...
Dialogue: 4,0:06:43.71,0:06:46.26,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Rin, do you know what a ninja is?
Dialogue: 4,0:06:46.26,0:06:49.55,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, Kouki-kun says he's gonna be a ninja.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:50.84,0:06:54.31,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,They say that ninjas jump over a hemp plant every day,
Dialogue: 4,0:06:54.31,0:06:56.85,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,so as the plant gets bigger and bigger and by the time it's full grown,
Dialogue: 4,0:06:56.85,0:06:59.48,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,they're jumping at an incredible height.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:59.48,0:07:01.48,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Huh...
Dialogue: 4,0:07:01.48,0:07:03.44,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Why don't you try that with your loquat?
Dialogue: 4,0:07:04.32,0:07:05.40,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I will!
Dialogue: 4,0:07:08.78,0:07:09.95,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Like that.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:12.82,0:07:14.03,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Like that?
Dialogue: 4,0:07:14.03,0:07:15.33,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:15.33,0:07:19.71,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, how high does a loquat tree get?
Dialogue: 4,0:07:19.71,0:07:21.46,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,About as high as our roof?
Dialogue: 4,0:07:21.46,0:07:23.58,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know... Well...
Dialogue: 4,0:07:23.58,0:07:24.79,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, that's probably about right...
Dialogue: 4,0:07:32.76,0:07:35.10,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, let's go inside.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:35.10,0:07:36.68,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,All right, after ten more times!
Dialogue: 4,0:07:39.52,0:07:42.10,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder if it'll sprout tomorrow.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:42.10,0:07:44.40,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Probably not by tomorrow...
Dialogue: 4,0:07:45.94,0:07:47.07,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Did you remember everything?
Dialogue: 4,0:07:47.07,0:07:48.36,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:50.82,0:07:54.74,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,My teacher said someone from home has to check my schedule, too.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:55.99,0:07:57.20,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What a pain...
Dialogue: 4,0:07:57.79,0:08:00.87,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,They didn't do this when I was a kid.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:01.79,0:08:05.21,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,You're right. It says, "Please confirm."
Dialogue: 4,0:08:10.80,0:08:11.92,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,A fire?
Dialogue: 4,0:08:11.92,0:08:13.76,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Police car, I believe...
Dialogue: 4,0:08:13.76,0:08:15.22,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,A crime?
Dialogue: 4,0:08:15.22,0:08:16.30,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:17.72,0:08:20.64,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, attach this whistle to my satchel.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:26.65,0:08:27.40,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Rin...
Dialogue: 4,0:08:28.61,0:08:30.90,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,If somebody you don't know starts talking to you,
Dialogue: 4,0:08:30.90,0:08:32.70,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,you blow on this to make a loud sound.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:32.70,0:08:33.40,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:33.40,0:08:36.45,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,And then run to any house!
Dialogue: 4,0:08:36.45,0:08:37.12,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:37.12,0:08:38.74,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,A store would be fine, too!
Dialogue: 4,0:08:38.74,0:08:39.62,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,All right!
Dialogue: 4,0:08:49.88,0:08:51.67,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Rin! School!
Dialogue: 4,0:08:51.67,0:08:53.80,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi! Come on, get up!
Dialogue: 4,0:08:53.80,0:08:55.55,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I'm gonna be late!
Dialogue: 4,0:08:56.18,0:08:57.39,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Okay...
Dialogue: 4,0:08:57.39,0:08:58.47,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you for the food.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:58.47,0:08:59.56,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you for the food!
Dialogue: 4,0:09:00.01,0:09:01.85,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,You put milk on it.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:01.85,0:09:04.56,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Can I eat just a little bit of it like this?
Dialogue: 4,0:09:04.56,0:09:05.89,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, I guess.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:10.23,0:09:13.36,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Pet dogs eat this kind of thing.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:13.36,0:09:15.11,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,That's dog food!
Dialogue: 4,0:09:15.11,0:09:16.57,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,It's only for dogs.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:16.57,0:09:17.91,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 4,0:09:17.91,0:09:19.32,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,That's right!
Dialogue: 4,0:09:19.32,0:09:22.37,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Humans can't eat dog food!
Dialogue: 4,0:09:22.37,0:09:23.58,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Huh...
Dialogue: 4,0:09:23.58,0:09:25.50,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Don't look regretful about it!
Dialogue: 4,0:09:29.79,0:09:30.63,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Is it good?
Dialogue: 4,0:09:30.63,0:09:32.34,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Uh-huh. Tasty!
Dialogue: 4,0:09:32.76,0:09:34.88,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Rice balls are still number one, though.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:34.88,0:09:37.01,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Those rice balls are tough to beat.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:37.01,0:09:38.64,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, your phone!
Dialogue: 4,0:09:38.64,0:09:39.30,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 4,0:09:43.22,0:09:45.02,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 4,0:09:45.02,0:09:49.40,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry. Kouki was so enthusiastic, he rushed out!
Dialogue: 4,0:09:49.40,0:09:50.56,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, that's okay.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:50.56,0:09:52.36,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,No problem.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:52.36,0:09:53.44,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Right...
Dialogue: 4,0:09:53.44,0:09:54.94,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-kun's here!
Dialogue: 4,0:09:54.94,0:09:56.11,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,He's here.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:00.32,0:10:01.07,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,What's up?
Dialogue: 4,0:10:01.78,0:10:04.24,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-kun, you've got burrs all over you!
Dialogue: 4,0:10:04.70,0:10:07.92,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What animal trail did you take to get here?
Dialogue: 4,0:10:07.92,0:10:09.46,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not an animal!
Dialogue: 4,0:10:09.46,0:10:12.04,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,And what's with your hair?
Dialogue: 4,0:10:12.04,0:10:13.88,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Rin, go get a comb.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:13.88,0:10:15.17,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 4,0:10:18.18,0:10:21.93,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Jeez, your satchel is scratched up now...
Dialogue: 4,0:10:21.93,0:10:26.73,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,And I bet you scraped that stick across people's walls too, didn't you?
Dialogue: 4,0:10:26.73,0:10:28.23,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Are you psychic?!
Dialogue: 4,0:10:28.23,0:10:30.27,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,It's completely obvious to me!
Dialogue: 4,0:10:30.27,0:10:33.11,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Is it because you did the same thing when you were little, Daikichi?
Dialogue: 4,0:10:33.65,0:10:35.48,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Rin, hurry up and get ready!
Dialogue: 4,0:10:35.48,0:10:36.78,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 4,0:10:37.19,0:10:38.78,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What's that look for?
Dialogue: 4,0:10:42.74,0:10:44.37,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,See you later!
Dialogue: 4,0:10:45.58,0:10:47.37,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Hold on a second!
Dialogue: 4,0:10:47.37,0:10:48.25,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,You still have time...
Dialogue: 4,0:10:50.04,0:10:51.46,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong?!
Dialogue: 4,0:10:55.84,0:10:57.30,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-kun!
Dialogue: 4,0:10:57.30,0:10:59.97,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,You're not supposed to blow that unless something happens!
Dialogue: 4,0:11:00.38,0:11:02.14,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-kun!
Dialogue: 4,0:11:03.10,0:11:04.39,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Knock it off!
Dialogue: 4,0:11:04.39,0:11:06.01,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Quit blowing that thing!
Dialogue: 4,0:11:06.56,0:11:09.39,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Otherwise when you really do need help, nobody's going to come!
Dialogue: 4,0:11:10.77,0:11:11.94,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Got it?
Dialogue: 4,0:11:14.94,0:11:16.82,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Then go ahead.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:17.23,0:11:18.94,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,See you later!
Dialogue: 4,0:11:21.86,0:11:24.07,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Watch out for cars!
Dialogue: 4,0:11:24.07,0:11:25.33,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 4,0:11:35.84,0:11:37.63,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-kun!
Dialogue: 4,0:11:37.63,0:11:39.46,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Let's take this way!
Dialogue: 4,0:11:39.46,0:11:41.43,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,We're not supposed to go out of our way.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:41.43,0:11:44.34,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,This isn't going out of our way. It's a shortcut!
Dialogue: 4,0:11:47.26,0:11:48.35,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,I hear that ninjas...
Dialogue: 4,0:11:48.77,0:11:51.14,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,...always take paths like this!
Dialogue: 4,0:11:51.98,0:11:53.60,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Sheesh...
Dialogue: 4,0:11:59.11,0:12:00.44,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It zigzags!
Dialogue: 4,0:12:00.44,0:12:01.11,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Right?
Dialogue: 4,0:12:20.88,0:12:22.38,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-kun!
Dialogue: 4,0:12:22.38,0:12:23.68,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,You're too slow!
Dialogue: 4,0:12:24.13,0:12:26.30,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,That makes the shortcut pointless!
Dialogue: 4,0:12:31.98,0:12:33.44,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,That's not what you do!
Dialogue: 4,0:12:44.86,0:12:47.07,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-kun...
Dialogue: 4,0:13:05.63,0:13:08.76,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,That kid's hopeless...
Dialogue: 4,0:13:08.76,0:13:09.93,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I know, right?
Dialogue: 4,0:13:10.35,0:13:12.31,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Well, I guess it's...
Dialogue: 4,0:13:12.81,0:13:15.85,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Really, almost all boys are like that.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:15.85,0:13:17.44,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi...
Dialogue: 4,0:13:18.36,0:13:21.65,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,The only ninja training I condone is jumping over the loquat, right?
Dialogue: 4,0:13:21.65,0:13:22.40,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Right!
Dialogue: 4,0:13:29.70,0:13:33.45,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, that loquat's a school entrance commemoration, right?
Dialogue: 4,0:13:33.45,0:13:34.33,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:34.79,0:13:39.25,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,But your olive tree is a remembrance from when you were born,
Dialogue: 4,0:13:39.25,0:13:40.79,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,so it's a little different, right?
Dialogue: 4,0:13:41.71,0:13:45.26,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe I don't have anything like a fragrant olive tree...
Dialogue: 4,0:13:45.72,0:13:48.22,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,You're a sharp girl...
Dialogue: 4,0:13:48.80,0:13:52.26,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Did that mom of hers plant a tree or anything?
Dialogue: 4,0:13:54.02,0:13:56.23,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Or maybe there's one at Grandpa's house.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:56.81,0:13:59.23,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, Grandpa might've...
Dialogue: 4,0:13:59.65,0:14:02.48,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,But you don't know anything about one there, do you?
Dialogue: 4,0:14:02.48,0:14:03.36,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,No.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:05.36,0:14:08.70,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,And Grandpa's gone...
Dialogue: 4,0:14:09.28,0:14:13.24,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,If I don't know about it, no one does, right?
Dialogue: 4,0:14:15.04,0:14:18.79,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I never should've told her about the olive tree...
Dialogue: 4,0:14:20.00,0:14:22.75,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi! You've got your elbow on the table again!
Dialogue: 4,0:14:22.75,0:14:24.13,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Right. Sorry...
Dialogue: 4,0:14:37.23,0:14:38.19,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Crap...
Dialogue: 4,0:14:41.35,0:14:44.86,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,I didn't think we'd be meeting again.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:45.32,0:14:48.82,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I had the exact same thought.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:52.91,0:14:55.41,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,This is from her school entrance ceremony.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:55.83,0:14:56.87,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you...
Dialogue: 4,0:14:59.12,0:15:00.54,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,A tree for Rin?
Dialogue: 4,0:15:04.04,0:15:06.05,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,There is one! There was one!
Dialogue: 4,0:15:06.05,0:15:07.55,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,There is?!
Dialogue: 4,0:15:07.55,0:15:10.80,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Um... I think there was.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:10.80,0:15:13.22,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Why are you so unsure about it?
Dialogue: 4,0:15:13.80,0:15:16.43,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Because Souichi-san is the one who planted it...
Dialogue: 4,0:15:16.93,0:15:18.35,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Grandpa did...
Dialogue: 4,0:15:23.94,0:15:27.61,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I'd like to transfer that tree to my place.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:27.98,0:15:29.61,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What kind of tree is it?
Dialogue: 4,0:15:29.61,0:15:31.36,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,A small one...
Dialogue: 4,0:15:31.36,0:15:33.66,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,No, I mean what type, if you know...
Dialogue: 4,0:15:33.66,0:15:35.37,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,And the location...
Dialogue: 4,0:15:35.37,0:15:38.33,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Mmm, it's still small,
Dialogue: 4,0:15:38.33,0:15:40.41,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,and the branches are thin...
Dialogue: 4,0:15:41.75,0:15:42.87,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,It's here.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:45.71,0:15:47.71,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,You {\i1}are{\i0} a mangaka, yes?
Dialogue: 4,0:15:47.71,0:15:51.13,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Drawing maps isn't my job!
Dialogue: 4,0:15:51.63,0:15:53.51,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Which way is north?
Dialogue: 4,0:15:53.51,0:15:54.43,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,North?
Dialogue: 4,0:15:54.43,0:15:56.89,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,The sun rises in the west, so...
Dialogue: 4,0:15:56.89,0:15:58.72,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,The opposite! It rises in the east!
Dialogue: 4,0:15:59.35,0:16:00.73,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Never mind directions.
Dialogue: 4,0:16:00.73,0:16:03.35,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Just please draw the street that's in front of the house.
Dialogue: 4,0:16:03.35,0:16:05.65,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, yeah... Duh.
Dialogue: 4,0:16:08.02,0:16:11.24,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Well, I've got work to do, so excuse me.
Dialogue: 4,0:16:11.24,0:16:12.49,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you for the ice cream.
Dialogue: 4,0:16:12.95,0:16:15.57,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry to bother you when you're so busy.
Dialogue: 4,0:16:36.18,0:16:38.97,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder if I did have my own tree.
Dialogue: 4,0:16:39.47,0:16:43.27,Main Dialog,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sure Grandpa planted something for you, Rin-chan.
Dialogue: 4,0:16:43.27,0:16:45.56,Main Dialog,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,That's what my instinct tells me.
Dialogue: 4,0:16:45.56,0:16:49.32,Main Dialog,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,And even if there isn't, I think you could plant another tree
Dialogue: 4,0:16:49.32,0:16:51.78,Main Dialog,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,to commemorate you starting elementary school.
Dialogue: 4,0:16:51.78,0:16:53.53,Main Dialog,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,A tree that's six years old.
Dialogue: 4,0:16:54.15,0:16:55.28,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 4,0:16:55.28,0:16:57.62,Main Dialog,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,Do you want to see Daikichi's tree?
Dialogue: 4,0:16:57.62,0:16:59.62,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, I wanna see it!
Dialogue: 4,0:17:02.08,0:17:04.08,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It's big, isn't it?
Dialogue: 4,0:17:04.08,0:17:06.83,Main Dialog,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,That's because it's 30 years old, just like Daikichi.
Dialogue: 4,0:17:06.83,0:17:09.71,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It got big, and Daikichi did, too...
Dialogue: 4,0:17:10.80,0:17:12.51,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It's a fragrant olive, right?
Dialogue: 4,0:17:12.51,0:17:14.93,Main Dialog,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,That's right. You know your trees.
Dialogue: 4,0:17:14.93,0:17:16.22,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi told me.
Dialogue: 4,0:17:16.68,0:17:18.60,Main Dialog,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,This one is Kazumi's tree.
Dialogue: 4,0:17:18.60,0:17:19.93,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Tea olive?
Dialogue: 4,0:17:19.93,0:17:21.01,Main Dialog,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,Right...
Dialogue: 4,0:17:22.47,0:17:27.23,Main Dialog,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,Do you remember the big tree in Grandpa's backyard?
Dialogue: 4,0:17:27.23,0:17:28.86,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, that one?
Dialogue: 4,0:17:34.82,0:17:38.20,Main Dialog,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,That's my tree, a tea olive.
Dialogue: 4,0:17:38.20,0:17:39.95,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Huh...
Dialogue: 4,0:17:44.16,0:17:46.96,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? This tree...
Dialogue: 4,0:17:47.71,0:17:51.63,Main Dialog,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,Grandpa planted it when I was born.
Dialogue: 4,0:17:58.05,0:18:00.89,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,You have the same tree as Kazumi-chan, huh?
Dialogue: 4,0:18:00.89,0:18:02.22,Main Dialog,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,That's right.
Dialogue: 4,0:18:04.22,0:18:07.89,Main Dialog,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,When I was a child, I always compared my height to it.
Dialogue: 4,0:18:07.89,0:18:11.77,Main Dialog,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,I loved it, which is why I continued the tradition here.
Dialogue: 4,0:18:12.32,0:18:15.32,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Was that a tea olive tree?
Dialogue: 4,0:18:16.19,0:18:18.32,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Did Daikichi compare his height with his tree, too?
Dialogue: 4,0:18:18.32,0:18:19.45,Main Dialog,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,Of course!
Dialogue: 4,0:18:25.95,0:18:29.33,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Long before the day we first met...
Dialogue: 4,0:18:30.21,0:18:31.50,Main Dialog,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, is that...
Dialogue: 4,0:18:33.17,0:18:35.09,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It has the same leaves!
Dialogue: 4,0:18:35.84,0:18:38.01,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,A six-year-old fragrant olive tree.
Dialogue: 4,0:18:38.01,0:18:39.72,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Just like mine.
Dialogue: 4,0:18:46.56,0:18:47.93,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,This'll do.
Dialogue: 4,0:18:48.60,0:18:50.40,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Shoot!
Dialogue: 4,0:18:50.40,0:18:51.10,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 4,0:18:51.52,0:18:53.86,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It's too late to jump over this one, isn't it?
Dialogue: 4,0:18:55.48,0:18:57.24,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I don't think I could even do it...
Dialogue: 4,0:19:16.63,0:19:21.09,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,And we weren't even aware Rin existed until six months ago, you know?
Dialogue: 4,0:19:21.09,0:19:22.72,Main Dialog,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,I know.
Dialogue: 4,0:19:22.72,0:19:26.26,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi! The train's gonna leave!
Dialogue: 4,0:19:26.26,0:19:27.22,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Coming!
Dialogue: 4,0:19:27.97,0:19:28.93,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Well...
Dialogue: 4,0:19:29.64,0:19:31.23,Main Dialog,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,I'll see you off.
Dialogue: 4,0:19:34.11,0:19:35.15,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,But...
Dialogue: 4,0:19:35.98,0:19:40.03,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,long before the day we first met,
Dialogue: 4,0:19:49.45,0:19:53.88,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,we were all walking along a similar path.
Dialogue: 4,0:21:33.64,0:21:35.69,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi!
Dialogue: 4,0:21:36.52,0:21:37.85,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong?!
Dialogue: 4,0:21:38.86,0:21:40.02,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi!
Dialogue: 4,0:21:40.02,0:21:40.90,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What happened?!
Dialogue: 4,0:21:40.90,0:21:42.78,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,There's a strange old man outside!
Dialogue: 4,0:21:41.36,0:21:42.57,Alt,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-kun...
Dialogue: 4,0:21:42.57,0:21:44.86,Alt,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,No... That man is...
Dialogue: 4,0:21:42.78,0:21:44.36,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What?!
Dialogue: 4,0:21:44.86,0:21:46.65,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Where is he?!
Dialogue: 4,0:21:44.86,0:21:46.65,Alt,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, he's not...
Dialogue: 4,0:21:46.65,0:21:49.78,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Enough! Both of you, listen to me!
Dialogue: 4,0:21:50.37,0:21:52.74,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,That's our neighbor, Matsui-san!
Dialogue: 4,0:21:52.74,0:21:55.83,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Don't call him a "strange old man"!
Dialogue: 4,0:21:57.12,0:21:59.00,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry...
Dialogue: 4,0:22:01.84,0:22:06.51,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,I'm... sor...ry...
Dialogue: 4,0:22:06.51,0:22:08.13,Main Dialog,Matsui-san,0000,0000,0000,,It's okay, it's okay.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:08.13,0:22:11.89,Main Dialog,Matsui-san,0000,0000,0000,,Apparently, my sudden greeting frightened him.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:11.89,0:22:13.64,Main Dialog,Matsui-san,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:13.64,0:22:16.64,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,No, he was incredibly rude.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:16.64,0:22:19.27,Main Dialog,Matsui-san,0000,0000,0000,,Well, be careful going to school.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:19.27,0:22:20.77,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,See you later!
Dialogue: 4,0:22:26.69,0:22:27.95,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:29.53,0:22:32.99,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,When you ran away, you dragged Rin along with you.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:33.79,0:22:36.41,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,But Kouki-kun made a mistake...
Dialogue: 4,0:22:36.41,0:22:39.83,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,If Kouki's with you, I feel a little more at ease.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:39.83,0:22:41.08,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Just a little?!
Dialogue: 4,0:22:41.08,0:22:42.21,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, just a little!
Dialogue: 4,0:22:42.21,0:22:43.34,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,You're still a runt!
Dialogue: 4,0:22:43.34,0:22:45.00,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not a runt!
Dialogue: 4,0:22:47.38,0:22:49.59,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,We're going to be late...
